@startuml SD01_Connect
!include _style.iuml
title SD-01  Connect safety monitor (UC-01)  — REQ-01, REQ-02, REQ-48, REQ-55

actor Imager
participant "NINA\nSafetyMonitorChooser" as NINA
participant ":AllskySafetyMonitorProvider" as Prov
participant ":AllskySafetyMonitorDevice" as Dev
participant ":PluginSettingsStore" as Store
participant ":MonitorServiceBuilder" as Builder
participant ":MonitorService" as Svc
participant ":NinaMountStateSource" as Mount
participant "ITelescopeMediator" as TM

== NINA start-up ==
NINA -> Prov : GetEquipment()
Prov -> Dev ** : new(builder, adapters)
Prov --> NINA : [ AllskySafetyMonitorDevice ]
note right of NINA : Device listed in\nEquipment → Safety Monitor (REQ-01)

== Connect ==
Imager -> NINA : select device, Connect
NINA -> Dev : Connect(ct)
activate Dev
Dev -> Store : Load()
Store --> Dev : MonitorSettings (JSON, REQ-56)
Dev -> Mount : register()
Mount -> TM : RegisterConsumer(this)
Dev -> Builder : Build(settings, ports)
Builder -> Svc ** : new(cycle, guard, interval)
Builder --> Dev : service
Dev -> Svc : Start()
activate Svc
Svc -> Svc : launch background loop\n(status = Starting, unsafe)
Svc --> Dev
Dev --> NINA : true
deactivate Dev
NINA -> Dev : IsSafe
Dev --> NINA : false  (Starting)
note over Svc : First cycle runs on the background task;\nIsSafe stays false until a decision is made.
@enduml
